      "@type": "cat-harness:Tool",
      "description": "Compile the IG's CodeSystems with every `input/fsh/translations/<locale>.fsh` CodeSystem supplement in a throw-away FSHOnly SUSHI project, require 0 SUSHI errors, and check that each supplement's base CodeSystem is the IG's own, its codes are a subset of the base's, its language is the file's locale, and every CodeSystem id is unique. SUSHI is the version `ig-toolchain.env` pins, installed from `scripts/sushi/package-lock.json` with install scripts off; the FHIR core package is pinned by sha512; SUSHI runs with no network.",
      "install": {
        "cli": "npm ci --ignore-scripts --no-audit --no-fund --prefix fhir-harness/scripts/sushi"
      },
